[00:00.800]Lyrics：mpi
[00:02.890]Compose，Arrangement：澤野弘之
[00:05.060]Drums：佐野康夫    Bass：種子田健    Guitars：飯室博
[00:07.190]Rap：David Whitaker   Opening Vocal：mpi
[00:08.510]
[00:13.440]
[00:19.570]With this life, I’m exhausted
[00:22.190]They are frozen, people’s eyes
[00:24.550]Kind of close to endless mental slavery
[00:29.660]Always look up to the sky
[00:32.040]Is this what I’m living for?
[00:34.680]How can I spin this world better?
[00:39.410]Every place I used to live
[00:41.910]All the news we used to hear
[00:44.310]All the things we heard from you
[00:46.880]Are almost making fun of me
[00:49.350]Every day we work so hard
[00:51.740]Every thing will never change
[00:59.310]
[01:40.750]All of my life’s begun to change you, until the end
[01:50.390]Someone’s death means
[01:52.850]An indication of the new world
[01:57.800]They hope won’t be the same
[02:04.320]
[02:25.820]There’s a chance for me to find my way of life
[02:35.440]Anyway I know some nervous strain of time
[02:45.190]You cheer me reminds me
[02:49.230]There is a sun rise
[02:55.010]You told me to save me from a hell on earth
[03:03.760]All of the world’s begun to take me into the sun
[03:14.520]Hiding people getting out from crumbling shelter
[03:21.510]Now the time has come today
